{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PEPPERED is an existential platformer where you have <strong>ONE SHOT at everything. </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every choice, every boss battle, and every failure impact the branching plotline and determine how the story will go and how it will end. Will you save the world - or fail miserably?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883370/extras/Gif_Choices.gif?t=1744035641\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SYNOPSIS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Seeing apathy in the face of doomsday, an office intern decides to save the world by themselves. But the world responds by summoning the police, angry mobs, and the media, branding them as a terrorist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883370/extras/Sequence_03.gif?t=1744035641\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 BRANCHING NARRATIVE</strong><br>Multiple endings. Multiple story routes. Your failures and choices affect the story, which <strong>branches out heavily</strong> \u2014\u00a0sometimes taking you to completely unique locations with unique scenes, characters, or gameplay mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883370/extras/Sequence_04.gif?t=1744035641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 PLATFORMING ACTION</strong> <br>Run. Jump. Die. Scream at the screen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 ONE-SHOT BOSS FIGHTS</strong> <br>Challenging boss fights! If you lose, the game will not reset or give you a second chance \u2014 it will go on, incorporating your loss and changing the story accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 CHOICES</strong> <br>Make story choices, ranging from dialogue responses to actions. These will either affect the characters, the scene's outcome, or the ending you get. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 STEALTH SECTIONS</strong> <br>Get caught, sneak past, or find a secret solution. Every section features a unique character, permanent outcomes, and dumb gags. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883370/extras/Sequence_02.gif?t=1744035641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 EXPLORATION</strong> <br>Immerse yourself in a bizarre world full of weirdos and sad people! Talk with colorful NPCs, poke around the environment, or ignore it all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 COMPLETELY RANDOM CR*P</strong> <br>Maybe you'll have to use a shopping cart to run away from thugs? Perhaps you'll have to write a presentation or gamble with a street corner lunatic? Who knows? (I do.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 AN OFFICE CHAIR</strong> <br>You can spin in it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883370/extras/Sequence_06.gif?t=1744035641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883370/extras/Wishlists.png?t=1744035641\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ending 1: God of Debts.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1883370/e671b65abe75f63a4b4f0965bb4cc3f02f8967d0.jpg"},{"name":"Ending 2: Family Reunion.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1883370/7a097fa4e81eda1b698c06f1f1f6763cc9e96c44.jpg"},{"name":"Ending 3: Unsung Hero.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1883370/74ee9b2fd1ac664868a65f03b94a21eaf0ced01d.jpg"},{"name":"Ending 4: The Hero Who Freed The Death.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1883370/e85a55b35ca34f24a1efcf7fbd13f0659762862f.jpg"},{"name":"Ending 5: Welcome Home.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1883370/f978689e93cf1ae5fc4aa8a0d8192a8dda1f4d0f.jpg"},{"name":"Ending 6: 100% Completion.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1883370/993dea1fab2d10aca4315fd1f9524dd1a31d8856.jpg"},{"name":"Ending 7: Enemy of The State.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1883370/b51f708ee9a79253a3fb216fea9d390f8f20c643.jpg"},{"name":"Ending 8: Partners in Crime.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1883370/bfc0f2f897323cc298405fdf579ca1aa9529c254.jpg"},{"name":"Ending 9: Saved The World.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1883370/aa6e76666b3a0e8510c81fa917b22bd99adf45c2.jpg"},{"name":"Ending 10: Reunion.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1883370/0ce27b6c32740e80b72bd383a34505160f072581.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1883370?t=1744035641","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883370/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744035641","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883370/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744035641","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883370/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744035641","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}